# Canonical names for the commit history.
#
# The brief grades contribution from commit history and requires that
# CONTRIBUTIONS.md be corroborated by it. That only works if one person
# reads as one person: commits made through the GitHub web interface
# carry a different name and a noreply address from commits pushed from
# a laptop, so `git shortlog -sn` splits one contributor into two.
#
# This file fixes the display only. No commit is rewritten, no hash
# changes, and nobody has to re-clone.
#
#   git shortlog -sn        # now groups correctly
#   git log --use-mailmap   # same, per commit
#
# Format:  Canonical Name <canonical@email> <other@email>
#
# Teammates: add your own line if your commits appear under more than
# one name. Please only add your own.

Sun Yawen <2965182494@qq.com> <2965182494@qq.com>
